        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the highly regarded Castlelake development in Carrigtwohill, No. 4 Ashbrook is a gorgeous three-bedroom duplex that has been recently renovated and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\n\r\nThis attractive home combines bright, spacious accommodation with a modern, stylish interior and an excellent location. The property is ideally positioned for those seeking convenient access to both Cork City and Midleton, while also enjoying the amenities available locally in Carrigtwohill.\r\n\r\nThe Castlelake development is located just off the N25, providing easy access to Cork City, Little Island, and Midleton. Cork City is approximately 16 km away, while Midleton is conveniently located to the east. Carrigtwohill village is close by and provides a range of everyday amenities, while the local railway station offers a further excellent transport option with services towards Cork and Midleton.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\nWelcoming the entrance hall with access to the main living accommodation and guest WC.\r\nGuest WC:\r\nConvenient downstairs WC with wash hand basin and tiled floor.\r\nOpen Plan Living/Dining Room:\r\nA gorgeous, bright, and spacious open-plan living and dining area, providing an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining. The room features a feature fireplace with a gas fire, creating an attractive focal point, and benefits from access to two balconies—one to the front and one to the rear.\r\nThe living and dining area flows seamlessly into the kitchen, creating a superb open-plan interior with a wonderful sense of space and excellent natural light.\r\nKitchen:\r\nModern, fully fitted kitchen with excellent storage and workspace, opening directly into the living/dining area.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding:\r\nBright first-floor landing providing access to all three bedrooms and the family bathroom.\r\nFamily Bathroom:\r\nWell-appointed family bathroom with tiled walls and modern sanitary ware.\r\nMain Bedroom:\r\nExcellent double bedroom positioned to the front of the property, featuring built-in wardrobes and a fully tiled en-suite.\r\nBedroom Two:\r\nGood-sized double bedroom to the front of the property with built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom Three:\r\nDouble bedroom positioned to the rear of the property, also benefiting from built-in wardrobes.\r\nOutside\r\nResidents' parking is available within the development, with the property also benefiting from its dual-balcony arrangement, providing excellent outdoor space and a pleasant extension to the living accommodation.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nCastlelake is a popular residential development in Carrigtwohill, ideally located for commuters and families alike. The development is within easy reach of Carrigtwohill village and its local amenities, while the N25 provides straightforward access towards Cork City and Midleton. The local railway station is also within convenient reach, offering services towards Cork, Midleton, and Cobh.\r\nCork City is approximately 16 km away, making the property particularly attractive to those working in Cork while wishing to enjoy the benefits of living outside the city. Midleton is also readily accessible, while the surrounding area provides a range of schools, shops, sporting facilities, and other amenities.\r\nOverall.\r\n\r\nNo. 4 Ashbrook represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a gorgeous three-bedroom duplex that has been recently renovated and is presented in excellent condition throughout. With its spacious open-plan living accommodation, modern kitchen, three double bedrooms, master en-suite, built-in wardrobes, two balconies, and convenient location, this property would make an ideal home for first-time buyers, families, owner-occupiers, or investors alike."
      },
